{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a291","chatId":"7aea2b221bd342e083e218a433607f73","sessionId":null,"userId":68529,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":958,"promptTokens":1463,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607294394678995,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a290","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722177,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a290","chatId":"7aea2b221bd342e083e218a433607f73","sessionId":null,"userId":68529,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n艾瓦很兴奋地在奶奶的80大寿聚会上向她的家庭介绍自己的新男友扎克。她带扎克去见奶奶，扎克说：“哇，你看起来完全不像100岁！”\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，艾瓦最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 期待\nB) 开心\nC) 尴尬\nD) 悔恨\nE) 感激\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n艾瓦为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她男友把她奶奶喊老了20岁\nB) 艾瓦的新男朋友是扎克\nC) 扎克说她的奶奶看起来比实际年龄年轻\nD) 扎克没有受到她家人的热烈欢迎","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607294394678995,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a291","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722174,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f7be26ba7e7c487fbfec59b9f46f43ac"}